{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>\nHello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとう＼(^-^)／\nそしてそして、握手会に来てくださったかたありがとー♪\n初めてのハーフツインに挑戦しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんも楽しんでいただけたならば、めっちゃ嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前日の夜からドキドキしてて.........\nコメントしてくださるかたで、お会いしたことなくて、どんなかたなんだろー？\nとか思って.........。\n最高の握手会が出来ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イェイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのかたや、初めてのかた、いつものかた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても??嬉しかったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンッ！\n昨日の私服です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと短パン履いてるよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上の服の丈が長いから......"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この服はおばーちゃんに買っていただきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"イェイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！この前のblog見えにくくてごめんねー！\n黒の背景にして更新したんだけど、白になってたから、黄色い文字とか見れなかったよねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイムソーリーヒゲソーリー日本のそーりは野田そーり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、みゅみゅちゃまと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遠近法を使わないでくれーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーいえば"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みゅみゅちゃま"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の服を返してくだしゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度オウチにとりにいくねー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"oh！\nダンブルじぃじー(高山一実)\nこの前、服貸してくれてありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"oh！ミサミサこの前服くれてありがとー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この服！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いでしよー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みちゃちゃんありがとー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しつもーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんの住んでいる国の方言を教えて下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前のまあやの質問にも答えてくれてありがとー！\nみんな面白ーい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやと同じ間違えたした人もいてビックリ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カレーライスをカライライスとか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もーサイコー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントみながら一人でケラケラ笑っちったよー(*^^*)ありがとー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも皆様にパワーもらってるよーっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんがちょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/17/9261265/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}